>l</mi><msqrt><mn>16</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mi>l</mi><msqrt><mn>16</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>l</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>16</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>l</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>All that's left now is to confirm that <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"52\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D459 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-msqrt><mjx-sqrt><mjx-surd><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c221A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-surd><mjx-box style=\"padding-top: 0.174em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-box></mjx-sqrt></mjx-msqrt></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> does indeed give a maximum value of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax Ctx